{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>意大利及阿爾巴利亞亦爆發示威，僅意大利便有160人被帶署調查。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.PROTEST 0630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202670TjqaujQi1792363976.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>意大利米蘭連續第二天有抗議，有示威者打爛超市玻璃門入內搶掠，又在路中心放置雜物。全副武裝的警員，發射催淚彈驅散示威者，有示威者被捕。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.PROTEST 0630_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iGyAXI23UU1792363965.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>公眾不滿日益高漲的生活支出、燃料價格。總理梅洛尼譴責暴力行為，並計劃在周一召開公共安全會議。</p><p></p><p>至於阿爾巴尼亞首都地拉那，連續第六日爆發反政府示威。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.PROTEST 0630_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265oO9hWs8PI1792363971.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>大批蒙面的示威者，向防暴裝甲車投擲石塊，又焚燒雜物。示威最初由學生發動，呼籲政府關注大學辦學條件、教育成本等問題，之後示威變得暴力，並要求總理拉馬下台。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.PROTEST 0630_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xaFAiEbqKw1792363968.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:41.905761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:37:45.577794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:35.947660+00:00","content_hash":"d42f6be6e56ec9c0f7548e2c26927edb875fa198c45b29502caac16b675c51ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}